@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 89(2)(b)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 89(2)(b) — former class A2 entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        (    `Article 34 — the kind of` v EQUALS `a motorcycle`
         AND v's `wheels` EQUALS 2
         AND `towing nothing` v
         AND CONSIDER v's `motive power`
             WHEN `a heat engine` cc     THEN cc AT LEAST 175
             WHEN `an electric motor` kw THEN kw AT LEAST 14
             OTHERWISE FALSE)
    OR  `Article 89(2)(a) — former class A1 entitles the driving of` v

-- "and similar vehicles" ("và các xe tương tự") is not decided: Article 34(1)(h) is not.
