GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 89(2)(e) — former class B1 entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        (`an automobile of the former class B size` v AND `towing nothing` v)
    OR  (`a tractor` v AND v's `payload in kg` LESS THAN 3500)

