`Article 89(2)(h) — former class C entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        (`an automobile of the former class C size` v AND `towing nothing` v)
    OR  (`a tractor` v AND v's `payload in kg` AT LEAST 3500)
    OR  `Article 89(2)(dd) — former class B1, automatic, entitles the driving of` v
    OR  `Article 89(2)(e) — former class B1 entitles the driving of` v
    OR  `Article 89(2)(g) — former class B2 entitles the driving of` v

