        `an automobile of the former class B size` v
    AND `towing a trailer` v

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 89(2)(l)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 89(2)(l) — former class FD entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        (   `an automobile of the former class D size` v
         OR `an automobile of the former class C size` v
         OR `an automobile of the former class B size` v)
    AND `towing a trailer` v

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 89(2)(l)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 89(2)(l) — former class FC entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        (    (   `an automobile of the former class C size` v
              OR `an automobile of the former class B size` v)
         AND `towing a trailer` v)
    OR  `a semi-trailer tractor unit towing a semi-trailer` v

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 89(2)(l)
GIVEN v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 89(2)(l) — former class FE entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        (    (   `an automobile of the former class E size` v
              OR `an automobile of the former class D size` v
              OR `an automobile of the former class C size` v
              OR `an automobile of the former class B size` v)
         AND `towing a trailer` v)
    OR  (    `licensed as an automobile carrying persons` v
         AND v's `an articulated coach`)

-- The table: one arm per former class, in the order of Article 89(2).
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 89(2)
GIVEN c IS A `A licence class issued before 1 January 2025`
      v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 89(2) — a licence of` c `entitles the driving of` v MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `former class A1`  THEN `Article 89(2)(a) — former class A1 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class A2`  THEN `Article 89(2)(b) — former class A2 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class A3`  THEN `Article 89(2)(c) — former class A3 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class A4`  THEN `Article 89(2)(d) — former class A4 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class B1, automatic, for a non-professional driver` THEN `Article 89(2)(dd) — former class B1, automatic, entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class B1, for a non-professional driver`            THEN `Article 89(2)(e) — former class B1 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class B2, for a professional driver`                THEN `Article 89(2)(g) — former class B2 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class C`   THEN `Article 89(2)(h) — former class C entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class D`   THEN `Article 89(2)(i) — former class D entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class E`   THEN `Article 89(2)(k) — former class E entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class FB2` THEN `Article 89(2)(l) — former class FB2 entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class FC`  THEN `Article 89(2)(l) — former class FC entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class FD`  THEN `Article 89(2)(l) — former class FD entitles the driving of` v
    WHEN `former class FE`  THEN `Article 89(2)(l) — former class FE entitles the driving of` v

§§ `Article 89(3) — what a licence of a former class may be exchanged for`

-- Each answer is a list of options; each option is the set of documents issued in exchange.
-- Point (e) and (k) offer a choice of two classes ("hoặc"); the certificate for tractors goes
-- with either (fork F12).
-- src:2008 | 3. Trường hợp người có giấy phép lái xe đã được cấp trước ngày Luật này có
