-- src:2034 | hoặc hạng C1E và chứng chỉ điều khiển xe máy chuyên dùng cho người điều khiển
-- src:2035 | máy kéo có trọng tải đến 3.500 kg;
-- src:2036 | l) Giấy phép lái xe hạng FC được đổi, cấp lại sang giấy phép lái xe hạng CE và
-- src:2037 | chứng chỉ điều khiển xe máy chuyên dùng cho người điều khiển máy kéo có trọng
-- src:2038 | tải trên 3.500 kg;
-- src:2039 | 62 CÔNG BÁO/Số 979 + 980/Ngày 24-8-2024
-- src:2041 | m) Giấy phép lái xe hạng FD được đổi, cấp lại sang giấy phép lái xe hạng D2E
-- src:2042 | và chứng chỉ điều khiển xe máy chuyên dùng cho người điều khiển máy kéo có
-- src:2043 | trọng tải trên 3.500 kg;
-- src:2044 | n) Giấy phép lái xe hạng FE được đổi, cấp lại sang giấy phép lái xe hạng DE
-- src:2045 | và chứng chỉ điều khiển xe máy chuyên dùng cho người điều khiển máy kéo có
-- src:2046 | trọng tải trên 3.500 kg.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 89(3)
GIVEN c IS A `A licence class issued before 1 January 2025`
GIVETH A LIST OF (LIST OF `An exchange under Article 89(3)`)
`Article 89(3) — the exchanges open to a licence of` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `former class A1`  THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class A` `only two-wheeled motorcycles under 175 cm3 or under 14 kW`))
    WHEN `former class A2`  THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class A` `no restriction`))
    WHEN `former class A3`  THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class B1` `no restriction`))
    WHEN `former class A4`  THEN LIST (LIST `a certificate to operate tractors, up to 1,000 kg payload`, `a certificate of training in road-traffic law, for special-use machines`)
    WHEN `former class B1, automatic, for a non-professional driver` THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class B` `only automatic automobiles`))
    WHEN `former class B1, for a non-professional driver`            THEN `the exchanges of point (e)`
    WHEN `former class B2, for a professional driver`                THEN `the exchanges of point (e)`
    WHEN `former class C`   THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class C` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, above 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHEN `former class D`   THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class D2` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, above 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHEN `former class E`   THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class D` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, above 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHEN `former class FB2` THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class BE` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, up to 3,500 kg payload`),
                                      (LIST (`a licence of` `class C1E` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, up to 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHEN `former class FC`  THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class CE` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, above 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHEN `former class FD`  THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class D2E` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, above 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHEN `former class FE`  THEN LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class DE` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, above 3,500 kg payload`)
    WHERE
        `the exchanges of point (e)` MEANS
            LIST (LIST (`a licence of` `class B` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, up to 3,500 kg payload`),
                 (LIST (`a licence of` `class C1` `no restriction`), `a certificate to operate tractors, up to 3,500 kg payload`)

-- Article 89(4): a learner trained before this Law is tested and licensed in the classes of
-- Article 89(3). Article 89(5)-(6): registrations of special-use machines and inspection
-- certificates issued before stay valid. Article 89(7): plate auctions. Not encoded
-- (NOTES.md section 2).
-- src:2047 | 4. Người học lái xe đã được đào tạo lái xe trước ngày Luật này có hiệu lực thi
-- src:2048 | hành hoặc đang được đào tạo lái xe tại ngày Luật này có hiệu lực thi hành chưa
-- src:2049 | được sát hạch, cấp giấy phép lái xe thì được sát hạch, cấp giấy phép lái xe theo
-- src:2050 | hạng giấy phép lái xe đổi, cấp lại quy định tại khoản 3 Điều này.

§§ `A licence of either vintage`

-- A licence of an Article 57 class is issued under this Law, from 1 January 2025; one of a
-- former class was issued before. A record that says otherwise is contradictory, and the model
-- declines it.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 88(1), 89(1)-(2)
GIVEN l IS A `A driving licence`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the class agrees with the date of issue of the licence` l MEANS
    CONSIDER l's `class`
    WHEN `a class under Article 57` c          THEN `Article 88 — this Law governs` (l's `date of issue`)
    WHEN `a class issued before this Law` f    THEN NOT `Article 88 — this Law governs` (l's `date of issue`)

@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 88(1), 89(1)-(2)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the licence's class does not agree with its date of issue: an Article 57 class is issued from 1 January 2025 and a former class before it` MEANS
    REFUSE "the licence's class does not agree with its date of issue: an Article 57 class is issued from 1 January 2025 and a former class before it"

-- What the licence's class, with its restriction, entitles its holder to drive.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 57(1), 89(2), 89(3)(a), (đ)
GIVEN l IS A `A driving licence`
      v IS A `A road vehicle`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the class of the licence` l `entitles the driving of` v MEANS
        `the restriction` (l's `restriction`) `leaves the driving of` v
    AND CONSIDER l's `class`
        WHEN `a class under Article 57` c       THEN `Article 57(1) — a licence of` c `entitles the driving of` v
        WHEN `a class issued before this Law` f THEN `Article 89(2) — a licence of` f `entitles the driving of` v

-- The last day the licence is valid, by Article 57(5) or Article 89(1); NOTHING for none.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 57(5), 89(1)
GIVEN l IS A `A driving licence`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`the last day of validity of the licence` l MEANS
    CONSIDER l's `class`
    WHEN `a class under Article 57` c       THEN `Article 57(5) — the last day of validity of a licence of` c `recorded as` l
    WHEN `a class issued before this Law` f THEN `Article 89(1) — the last day of validity of a licence issued before this Law` l

-- Article 57(7)(a): the licence has expired ("hết thời hạn sử dụng") after its last day.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 57(7)(a), 89(1)
GIVEN l IS A `A driving licence`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 57(7)(a) — the licence` l `has expired by` d MEANS
    CONSIDER `the last day of validity of the licence` l
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST e  THEN d GREATER THAN e

-- Article 57(7): in force ("có hiệu lực") on the day: issued by then, not expired, not revoked.
-- Points and a withdrawal of the right to use are not among 57(7)'s cases (finding R5).
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 57(7)
GIVEN l IS A `A driving licence`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 57(7) — the licence` l `is in force on` d MEANS
        l's `date of issue` AT MOST d
    AND NOT `Article 57(7)(a) — the licence` l `has expired by` d
    AND NOT `Article 57(7)(b) — the licence` l `has been revoked under Article 62(5) by` d

-- Article 56(1): a licence "đang còn điểm, còn hiệu lực" (with points left, in force), whose
-- right of use is not withdrawn on the day. A contradictory record is declined.
-- src:969 | 1. Người lái xe tham gia giao thông đường bộ phải đủ tuổi, sức khỏe theo quy
-- src:970 | định của pháp luật; có giấy phép lái xe đang còn điểm, còn hiệu lực phù hợp với
-- src:971 | loại xe đang điều khiển do cơ quan có thẩm quyền cấp, trừ người lái xe gắn máy
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 56(1), 57(7), 58(3)
GIVEN l IS A `A driving licence`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 56(1) — the licence` l `may be driven under on` d MEANS
    IF   NOT `the class agrees with the date of issue of the licence` l
    THEN `the licence's class does not agree with its date of issue: an Article 57 class is issued from 1 January 2025 and a former class before it`
    ELSE     `Article 57(7) — the licence` l `is in force on` d
         AND `Article 58(3) — points are left on the licence` l
         AND NOT `the right to use the licence` l `is withdrawn on` d
